# PAYTUNE — COMPLETE DATABASE WORKFLOW VERIFICATION AND IMPLEMENTATION PROMPT

## PRIMARY OBJECTIVE

Complete, audit, and verify the entire PAYTUNE PostgreSQL/Supabase database so that every major platform feature has real, secure, production-ready database functionality.

The goal is not to create a demonstration database, a mock backend, a partial schema, or an artist-only database.

PAYTUNE is a complete entertainment, music, video, short-video, livestreaming, social, advertising, creator monetization, subscription, and financial platform.

Your task is to inspect the existing PAYTUNE application, inspect the actual connected Supabase/PostgreSQL database, identify every missing or incomplete workflow, and produce one comprehensive, compatible, production-ready `init.sql` that implements the missing database functionality while preserving all existing working functionality.

**Do not assume a feature is complete because its frontend page, controller, API endpoint, or dashboard already exists. Verify the actual database operations, relationships, constraints, authorization, transaction handling, and persistence behind each feature.**

